@page "/"

@* Static SSR page (no @rendermode) - the app's default rendering model. *@
<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Syncfusion Blazor - Toast, Progress Bar &amp; Tooltip</h1>

<p>
    This page is rendered with <strong>Static SSR</strong> (no render mode). Pages that contain interactive
    controls opt in with <code>@@rendermode InteractiveServer</code>.
</p>

<ul>
    <li><a href="toast">Toast</a> - injectable <code>ToastService</code>; one line per page to show a toast.</li>
    <li><a href="progressbar">Progress Bar</a> - indeterminate linear/circular loaders (replacement for a GIF).</li>
    <li><a href="tooltip">Tooltip</a> - tooltips on buttons, icons and plain HTML elements.</li>
</ul>
